 "howItWorks": "Each Stream Deck button holds ONE Elgato 'Hotkey' action that sends the listed key. The web app listens for F13-F24 (plus the Shift row) and drives the same code as the on-screen control. The browser tab with the app must be focused. A USB Stream Deck cannot control iPad Safari; plug the deck into the Mac/PC running the browser. If your keyboard has no F13-F24 to record from, use the altChord on each button instead (Ctrl+Option+key): the app treats both dialects the same.",
